 214:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 215:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *  This function initializes the BLE Stack which consists of the BLE Stack
 216:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *  Manager, BLE Controller, and BLE Host modules. It takes care of initializing
