 743:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** ****************************************************************************//**
 744:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 745:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * This function requests the BLE Stack to put Bluetooth Low Energy Sub-System
 746:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * (BLESS) to DeepSleep mode.
 747:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 748:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * It is registered to the system power mode by Cy_SysPm_RegisterCallback()
 749:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * function with CY_SYSPM_DEEPSLEEP type. After registration it is called by
 750:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * Cy_SysPm_DeepSleep() function prior entering the core into the Deep Sleep
 751:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * power mode.
 752:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 753:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * When it is called with the enMode parameter set to CY_SYSPM_CHECK_READY,
 754:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * function enters BLESS to CY_BLE_BLESS_DEEPSLEEP mode. It also checks the
 755:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * BLE Subsystem's current operational mode. When the
 756:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * Cy_BLE_StackGetBleSsState() function returns CY_BLE_BLESS_STATE_ECO_ON or
 757:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * CY_BLE_BLESS_STATE_DEEPSLEEP state, this function returns CY_SYSPM_PASS and
 758:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * allows to put the core into the Deep Sleep power mode.
 759:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * At all other times, the function tries to enter core into sleep mode.
 760:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 761:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * This function is available only when BLE low power mode is enabled in the
 762:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * Advanced tab of customizer.
 763:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** *
 764:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * \param
 765:Generated_Source\PSoC6\pdl\middleware\ble/cy_ble.c **** * callbackParams  pointer to the structure with the syspm callback parameters
